description:
Mechanisms exist to select appropriate risk treatment options, based on applicable risk assessment findings, including:
(1) Mitigating the risk to an acceptable level;
(2) Avoiding the risk (e.g., terminating the project);
(3) Transferring the risk to a third party (e.g., insurance and service provider); or
(4) Accepting the risk.

